{"v":4,"catch":"謀殺案發生了，當地治安官需要你的幫助！","desc":"來自大城市的偵探艾麗西亞來到一個安靜的山區小鎮度假。\n但是謀殺發生了，當地治安官需要她的幫助。\n為解開儀式謀殺背後的謎團，艾麗西亞將穿越山城、深林、古宅等諸多地點。\n期待意外，因為這個不尋常的情節曲折地穿過看似沉睡的湖邊小鎮。\n\n- 解決棘手的謀殺案\n- 解鎖閃回動畫\n- 獲得十幾個成就\n- 玩大量令人興奮的迷你游戲\n- 完整的策略指南","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2023-04-20","genres":["冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","葡萄牙文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.5GB / Switch 1.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/af8028b9b4a2f29ac9045d78b117141ce188288130d4f362891ff82a74de2e58.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/147130378ad2d2eb2e6b0de83e6fb6be1507e949b0165135b09ae6c915558960.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/03063fc3a9a8c3b94ce1d476a63b7ddcd2459cdceb0253c5a5107a69094de038.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7fe2c496a8ea83709ada2fe1ab7bbec0703ea63b4c3568affc993af1dc3c7473.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dfe5eaebef1ad7b99af7a62ecaeccd45b9b0fb612f90f342925edbd9c429b71e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/06e69a1f22cd652b4f23ca566e9e45a26c4ecdac9b542590a3bdf2de33c95d5b.jpg"],"titleId":"010060d01ac00000","dlc":[]}